  FT["PH-H8642"] = {"id":"PH-H8642","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10189_2012.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立San Jose Del Monte市","en":"An Act Establishing a National High School in Barangay San Martin III, City of San Jose Del Monte, Province of Bulacan to Be Known as San Martin National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Establishing a National High School in Barangay San Martin III, City of San Jose Del Monte, Province of Bulacan to Be Known as San Martin National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật thành lập Trường trung học phổ thông quốc gia tại Barangay San Martin III, Thành phố San Jose Del Monte, Tỉnh Bulacan được biết đến với tên gọi Trường trung học phổ thông quốc gia San Martin","th":"พระราชบัญญัติจัดตั้งโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาตอนปลายแห่งชาติในบารังไกย์ San Martin III, เมือง San Jose Del Monte, จังหวัด Bulacan ให้เป็นที่รู้จักในชื่อโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาตอนปลายแห่งชาติ San Martin","id":"Undang-Undang mendirikan Sekolah Menengah Atas Nasional di Barangay San Martin III, Kota San Jose Del Monte, Provinsi Bulacan dikenal sebagai Sekolah Menengah Atas Nasional San Martin","ms":"Akta menubuhkan Sekolah Menengah Kebangsaan di Barangay San Martin III, Bandaraya San Jose Del Monte, Wilayah Bulacan dikenali sebagai Sekolah Menengah Kebangsaan San Martin"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["administrative","education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 10189","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2012-10-18","completenessNote":"全文，共 4 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10189_2012.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H8642-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Establishment of a National High School. - There shall be established, under the supervision of the Department of Education, a national high school in Barangay San Martin III, City of San Jose Del Monte, Province of Bulacan to be known as San Martin National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8642-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Appropriations. - The Secretary of Education shall immediately include in the Department’s program the operationalization of the San Martin National High School, the funding of which shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8642-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Implementation. – The Secretary of Education shall issue such rules and regulations as may be necessary to carry out the purpose of this Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8642-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Effectivity. – This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette."}}],"pack":"ph-p123"};
  FT["PH-H8643"] = {"id":"PH-H8643","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10190_2012.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"将宿务省 Daanbantayan 市镇 Tapilon 描笼涯的 Calape 国立中学附属校分离，改设为独立的 Tapilon 国立中学，并为此拨款","en":"An Act Separating the Calape National High School - Tapilon Annex in Barangay Tapilon, Municipality of Daanbantayan, Province of Cebu From the Calape National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Tapilon National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Separating the Calape National High School - Tapilon Annex in Barangay Tapilon, Municipality of Daanbantayan, Province of Cebu From the Calape National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Tapilon National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật tách Phân hiệu Tapilon của Trường Trung học Calape Quốc gia tại Barangay Tapilon, Đô thị Daanbantayan, Tỉnh Cebu khỏi Trường Trung học Calape Quốc gia và chuyển thành Trường Trung học Độc lập Quốc gia với tên gọi Trường Trung học Tapilon Quốc gia, và bố trí kinh phí","th":"พระราชบัญญัติแยกวิทยาเขต Tapilon ของโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Calape แห่งชาติในบารังไกย์ Tapilon เทศบาล Daanbantayan จังหวัด Cebu ออกจากโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Calape แห่งชาติและยกฐานะเป็นโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาเอกเทศแห่งชาติชื่อโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Tapilon แห่งชาติ และจัดสรรงบประมาณ","id":"Undang-Undang Memisahkan Kampus Tapilon, Sekolah Menengah Calape Nasional di Barangay Tapilon, Kotamadya Daanbantayan, Provinsi Cebu dari Sekolah Menengah Calape Nasional dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Mandiri Nasional dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Tapilon Nasional, dan mengalokasikan dana","ms":"Akta Memisahkan Kampus Tapilon, Sekolah Menengah Calape Kebangsaan di Barangay Tapilon, Perbandaran Daanbantayan, Wilayah Cebu daripada Sekolah Menengah Calape Kebangsaan dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Bebas Kebangsaan dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Tapilon Kebangsaan, dan memperuntukkan dana"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["administrative","education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 10190","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2012-10-18","completenessNote":"全文，共 5 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10190_2012.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H8643-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Separation and Conversion into a National High School. – The Calape National High School – Tapilon Annex in Barangay Tapilon, Municipality of Daanbantayan, Province of Cebu is hereby separated from the Calape National High School and converted into an independent national high school to be known as Tapilon National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8643-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Transfer of Assets and Liabilities. - All personnel, assets, liabilities and records of the Calape National High School-Tapilon Annex are hereby transferred to and absorbed by the Tapilon National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8643-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Appropriations. – The Secretary of Education shall immediately include in the Department’s program the operationalization of the Tapilon National High School, the initial funding of which shall be charged against the current year’s appropriations of the Calape National High School – Tapilon Annex. Thereafter, the amount necessary for the continued operation of the school shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8643-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Implementation. – The Department of Education shall issue such rules and regulations as may be necessary to carry out the provisions of this Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8643-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"Effectivity. - This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette."}}],"pack":"ph-p123","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act Separating the Calape National High School - Tapilon Annex in Barangay Tapilon, Municipality of Daanbantayan, Province of Cebu From the Calape National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Tapilon National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
  FT["PH-H8644"] = {"id":"PH-H8644","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10191_2012.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"将南苏里高省 Bislig 市 Tumanan 描笼涯的 Bislig 市国立中学附属校分离，改设为独立的 Tumanan 国立中学，并为此拨款","en":"An Act Separating the Bislig City National High School - Tumanan Annex in Barangay Tumanan, City of Bislig, Province of Surigao Del Sur From the Bislig City National High School. Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Tumanan National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Separating the Bislig City National High School - Tumanan Annex in Barangay Tumanan, City of Bislig, Province of Surigao Del Sur From the Bislig City National High School. Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Tumanan National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật tách Phân hiệu Tumanan của Trường Trung học Thành phố Bislig Quốc gia tại Barangay Tumanan, Thành phố Bislig, Tỉnh Surigao Del Sur khỏi Trường Trung học Thành phố Bislig Quốc gia và chuyển thành Trường Trung học Độc lập Quốc gia với tên gọi Trường Trung học Tumanan Quốc gia, và bố trí kinh phí","th":"พระราชบัญญัติแยกวิทยาเขต Tumanan ของโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาเมือง Bislig แห่งชาติในบารังไกย์ Tumanan เมือง Bislig จังหวัด Surigao Del Sur ออกจากโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาเมือง Bislig แห่งชาติและยกฐานะเป็นโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาเอกเทศแห่งชาติชื่อโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Tumanan แห่งชาติ และจัดสรรงบประมาณ","id":"Undang-Undang Memisahkan Kampus Tumanan, Sekolah Menengah Kota Bislig Nasional di Barangay Tumanan, Kota Bislig, Provinsi Surigao Del Sur dari Sekolah Menengah Kota Bislig Nasional dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Mandiri Nasional dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Tumanan Nasional, dan mengalokasikan dana","ms":"Akta Memisahkan Kampus Tumanan, Sekolah Menengah Bandar Bislig Kebangsaan di Barangay Tumanan, Bandar Bislig, Wilayah Surigao Del Sur daripada Sekolah Menengah Bandar Bislig Kebangsaan dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Bebas Kebangsaan dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Tumanan Kebangsaan, dan memperuntukkan dana"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["administrative","education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 10191","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2012-10-18","completenessNote":"全文，共 5 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10191_2012.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H8644-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Separation and Conversion into an Independent National High School. — The Bislig City National High School – Tumanan Annex in Barangay Tumanan, City of Bislig, Province of Surigao del Sur is hereby separated from the Bislig City National High School and converted into an independent national high school to be known as Tumanan National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8644-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Transfer of Assets and Liabilities. — All personnel assets, liabilities and records of the Bislig City National High School – Tumanan Annex are hereby transferred to and absorbed by the Tumanan National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8644-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Appropriations. — The Secretary of Education shall immediately include in the Department’s program the operationalization of the Tumanan National High School, the initial funding of which shall be charged against the current year’s appropriation of the Bislig City National High School – Tumanan Annex. Thereafter, the amount necessary for the continued operation of the school shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8644-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Implementation. – The Secretary of Education shall issue rules and regulations that may be necessary to carry out the purpose of this Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8644-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"Effectivity. – This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette."}}],"pack":"ph-p123","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act Separating the Bislig City National High School - Tumanan Annex in Barangay Tumanan, City of Bislig, Province of Surigao Del Sur From the Bislig City National High School. Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Tumanan National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
