  FT["PH-H8671"] = {"id":"PH-H8671","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10218_2012.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立Sindangan市","en":"An Act Establishing a National High School in Barangay Lapero, Municipality of Sindangan, Province of Zamboanga Del Norte to Be Known as Lapero National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Establishing a National High School in Barangay Lapero, Municipality of Sindangan, Province of Zamboanga Del Norte to Be Known as Lapero National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật thành lập Trường trung học phổ thông quốc gia tại Barangay Lapero, Thị trấn Sindangan, Tỉnh Zamboanga Del Norte được biết đến với tên gọi Trường trung học phổ thông quốc gia Lapero","th":"พระราชบัญญัติจัดตั้งโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาตอนปลายแห่งชาติในบารังไกย์ Lapero, เทศบาล Sindangan, จังหวัด Zamboanga Del Norte ให้เป็นที่รู้จักในชื่อโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาตอนปลายแห่งชาติ Lapero","id":"Undang-Undang mendirikan Sekolah Menengah Atas Nasional di Barangay Lapero, Kotamadya Sindangan, Provinsi Zamboanga Del Norte dikenal sebagai Sekolah Menengah Atas Nasional Lapero","ms":"Akta menubuhkan Sekolah Menengah Kebangsaan di Barangay Lapero, Perbandaran Sindangan, Wilayah Zamboanga Del Norte dikenali sebagai Sekolah Menengah Kebangsaan Lapero"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["administrative","education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 10218","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2012-10-18","completenessNote":"全文，共 4 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10218_2012.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H8671-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Establishment of a National High School. – There is hereby established, under the supervision of the Department of Education, a national high school in Barangay Lapero, Municipality of Sindangan, Province of Zamboanga del Norte to be known as Lapero National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8671-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Appropriations. – The Secretary of Education shall immediately include in the Department’s program the operationalization of the Lapero National High School, the funding of which shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8671-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Implementation. – The Secretary of Education shall issue such rules and regulations as may be necessary to carry out the purpose of this Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8671-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Effectivity. – This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette."}}],"pack":"ph-p123"};
  FT["PH-H8672"] = {"id":"PH-H8672","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10219_2012.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"将南苏里高省 Bislig 市 Sta. Cruz 描笼涯的 Bislig 市国立中学的 Sta. Cruz 附属校分离，改设为独立的同名国立中学，并为此拨款","en":"An Act Separating the Bislig City National High School - Sta. Cruz Annex in Barangay Sta. Cruz, City of Bislig, Province of Surigao Del Sur From the Bislig City National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Sta. Cruz National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Separating the Bislig City National High School - Sta. Cruz Annex in Barangay Sta. Cruz, City of Bislig, Province of Surigao Del Sur From the Bislig City National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Sta. Cruz National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật tách Phân hiệu Sta. Cruz của Trường Trung học Thành phố Bislig Quốc gia tại Barangay Sta. Cruz, Thành phố Bislig, Tỉnh Surigao Del Sur khỏi Trường Trung học Thành phố Bislig Quốc gia và chuyển thành Trường Trung học Độc lập Quốc gia với tên gọi Trường Trung học Sta. Cruz Quốc gia, và bố trí kinh phí","th":"พระราชบัญญัติแยกวิทยาเขต Sta. Cruz ของโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาเมือง Bislig แห่งชาติในบารังไกย์ Sta. Cruz เมือง Bislig จังหวัด Surigao Del Sur ออกจากโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาเมือง Bislig แห่งชาติและยกฐานะเป็นโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาเอกเทศแห่งชาติชื่อโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Sta. Cruz แห่งชาติ และจัดสรรงบประมาณ","id":"Undang-Undang Memisahkan Kampus Sta. Cruz, Sekolah Menengah Kota Bislig Nasional di Barangay Sta. Cruz, Kota Bislig, Provinsi Surigao Del Sur dari Sekolah Menengah Kota Bislig Nasional dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Mandiri Nasional dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Sta. Cruz Nasional, dan mengalokasikan dana","ms":"Akta Memisahkan Kampus Sta. Cruz, Sekolah Menengah Bandar Bislig Kebangsaan di Barangay Sta. Cruz, Bandar Bislig, Wilayah Surigao Del Sur daripada Sekolah Menengah Bandar Bislig Kebangsaan dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Bebas Kebangsaan dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Sta. Cruz Kebangsaan, dan memperuntukkan dana"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["administrative","education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 10219","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2012-10-18","completenessNote":"全文，共 5 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10219_2012.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H8672-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Separation and Conversion into an Independent National High School. – The Bislig City National High School – Sta. Cruz Annex in Barangay Sta. Cruz, City of Bislig, Province of Surigao del Sur is hereby separated from the Bislig City National High School and converted into an independent national high school to be known as Sta. Cruz National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8672-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Transfer of Assets and Liabilities. – All personnel, assets, liabilities and records of the Bislig City National High School – Sta. Cruz Annex are hereby transferred to and absorbed by the Sta. Cruz National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8672-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Appropriations. – The Secretary of Education shall immediately include in the Department’s program the operationalization of the Sta. Cruz National High School, the initial funding of which shall be charged against the current year’s appropriation of the Bislig City National High School – Sta. Cruz Annex. Thereafter, the amount necessary for the continued operation of the school shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8672-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Implementation. – The Secretary of Education shall issue rules and regulations that may be necessary to carry out the purpose of this Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8672-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"Effectivity. – This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette."}}],"pack":"ph-p123","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act Separating the Bislig City National High School - Sta. Cruz Annex in Barangay Sta. Cruz, City of Bislig, Province of Surigao Del Sur From the Bislig City National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Sta. Cruz National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
  FT["PH-H8673"] = {"id":"PH-H8673","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10220_2012.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"将南苏里高省 Bislig 市 Bucto 描笼涯的 Bislig 市国立中学附属校分离，改设为独立的 Bucto 国立中学，并为此拨款","en":"An Act Separating the Bislig City National High School - Bucto Annex in Barangay Bucto, City of Bislig, Province of Surigao Del Sur From the Bislig City National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Bucto National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Separating the Bislig City National High School - Bucto Annex in Barangay Bucto, City of Bislig, Province of Surigao Del Sur From the Bislig City National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Bucto National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật tách Phân hiệu Bucto của Trường Trung học Thành phố Bislig Quốc gia tại Barangay Bucto, Thành phố Bislig, Tỉnh Surigao Del Sur khỏi Trường Trung học Thành phố Bislig Quốc gia và chuyển thành Trường Trung học Độc lập Quốc gia với tên gọi Trường Trung học Bucto Quốc gia, và bố trí kinh phí","th":"พระราชบัญญัติแยกวิทยาเขต Bucto ของโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาเมือง Bislig แห่งชาติในบารังไกย์ Bucto เมือง Bislig จังหวัด Surigao Del Sur ออกจากโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาเมือง Bislig แห่งชาติและยกฐานะเป็นโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาเอกเทศแห่งชาติชื่อโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Bucto แห่งชาติ และจัดสรรงบประมาณ","id":"Undang-Undang Memisahkan Kampus Bucto, Sekolah Menengah Kota Bislig Nasional di Barangay Bucto, Kota Bislig, Provinsi Surigao Del Sur dari Sekolah Menengah Kota Bislig Nasional dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Mandiri Nasional dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Bucto Nasional, dan mengalokasikan dana","ms":"Akta Memisahkan Kampus Bucto, Sekolah Menengah Bandar Bislig Kebangsaan di Barangay Bucto, Bandar Bislig, Wilayah Surigao Del Sur daripada Sekolah Menengah Bandar Bislig Kebangsaan dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Bebas Kebangsaan dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Bucto Kebangsaan, dan memperuntukkan dana"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["administrative","education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 10220","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2012-10-18","completenessNote":"全文，共 5 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10220_2012.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H8673-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Separation and Conversion into an Independent National High School. – The Bislig City National High School – Bucto Annex (Annex VIII) situated in Barangay Bucto, City of Bislig, Province of Surigao del Sur is hereby separated from the Bislig City National High School and converted into an independent national high school to be known as Bucto National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8673-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Transfer of Assets and Liabilities. – All personnel, assets, liabilities and records of the Bislig City National High School – Bucto Annex are hereby transferred to and absorbed by the Bucto National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8673-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Appropriations. – The Secretary of Education shall immediately include in the Department’s program the operationalization of the Bucto National High School, the initial funding of which shall be charged against the current year’s appropriation of the Bislig City National High School – Bucto Annex. Thereafter, the amount necessary for the continued operation of the school shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8673-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Implementation. – The Secretary of Education shall issue rules and regulations that may be necessary to carry out the purpose of this Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8673-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"Effectivity. – This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette."}}],"pack":"ph-p123","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act Separating the Bislig City National High School - Bucto Annex in Barangay Bucto, City of Bislig, Province of Surigao Del Sur From the Bislig City National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Bucto National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
  FT["PH-H8674"] = {"id":"PH-H8674","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10221_2012.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立Kasibu市","en":"An Act Establishing a National High School in Barangay Didipio, Municipality of Kasibu, Province of Nueva Vizcaya to Be Known as Eastern Nueva Vizcaya National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Establishing a National High School in Barangay Didipio, Municipality of Kasibu, Province of Nueva Vizcaya to Be Known as Eastern Nueva Vizcaya National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật thành lập Trường trung học phổ thông quốc gia tại Barangay Didipio, Thị trấn Kasibu, Tỉnh Nueva Vizcaya được biết đến với tên gọi Trường trung học phổ thông quốc gia Eastern Nueva Vizcaya","th":"พระราชบัญญัติจัดตั้งโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาตอนปลายแห่งชาติในบารังไกย์ Didipio, เทศบาล Kasibu, จังหวัด Nueva Vizcaya ให้เป็นที่รู้จักในชื่อโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาตอนปลายแห่งชาติ Eastern Nueva Vizcaya","id":"Undang-Undang mendirikan Sekolah Menengah Atas Nasional di Barangay Didipio, Kotamadya Kasibu, Provinsi Nueva Vizcaya dikenal sebagai Sekolah Menengah Atas Nasional Eastern Nueva Vizcaya","ms":"Akta menubuhkan Sekolah Menengah Kebangsaan di Barangay Didipio, Perbandaran Kasibu, Wilayah Nueva Vizcaya dikenali sebagai Sekolah Menengah Kebangsaan Eastern Nueva Vizcaya"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["administrative","education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 10221","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2012-10-18","completenessNote":"全文，共 4 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10221_2012.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H8674-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Establishment of a National High School. – There is hereby established, under the supervision of the Department of Education, a national high school in Barangay Didipio, Municipality of Kasibu, Province of Nueva Vizcaya to be known as Eastern Nueva Vizcaya National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8674-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Appropriations. – The Secretary of Education shall immediately include in the Department’s program the operationalization of the Eastern Nueva Vizcaya National High School, the funding of which shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8674-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Implementation. – The Secretary of Education shall issue rules and regulations that may be necessary to carry out the purpose of this Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8674-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Effectivity. – This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette."}}],"pack":"ph-p123"};
  FT["PH-H8675"] = {"id":"PH-H8675","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10222_2012.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"将萨马省 Sta. Margarita 市镇 Napuro 描笼涯的 Sta. Margarita 国立中学的 Napuro 附属校分离，改设为独立的同名国立中学，并为此拨款","en":"An Act Separating the Sta. Margarita National High School - Napuro Annex in Barangay Napuro, Municipality of Sta. Margarita, Province of Samar From the Sta. Margarita National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Napuro National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Separating the Sta. Margarita National High School - Napuro Annex in Barangay Napuro, Municipality of Sta. Margarita, Province of Samar From the Sta. Margarita National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Napuro National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật tách Phân hiệu Napuro của Trường Trung học Sta. Margarita Quốc gia tại Barangay Napuro, Đô thị Sta. Margarita, Tỉnh Samar khỏi Trường Trung học Sta. Margarita Quốc gia và chuyển thành Trường Trung học Độc lập Quốc gia với tên gọi Trường Trung học Napuro Quốc gia, và bố trí kinh phí","th":"พระราชบัญญัติแยกวิทยาเขต Napuro ของโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Sta. Margarita แห่งชาติในบารังไกย์ Napuro เทศบาล Sta. Margarita จังหวัด Samar ออกจากโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Sta. Margarita แห่งชาติและยกฐานะเป็นโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษาเอกเทศแห่งชาติชื่อโรงเรียนมัธยมศึกษา Napuro แห่งชาติ และจัดสรรงบประมาณ","id":"Undang-Undang Memisahkan Kampus Napuro, Sekolah Menengah Sta. Margarita Nasional di Barangay Napuro, Kotamadya Sta. Margarita, Provinsi Samar dari Sekolah Menengah Sta. Margarita Nasional dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Mandiri Nasional dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Napuro Nasional, dan mengalokasikan dana","ms":"Akta Memisahkan Kampus Napuro, Sekolah Menengah Sta. Margarita Kebangsaan di Barangay Napuro, Perbandaran Sta. Margarita, Wilayah Samar daripada Sekolah Menengah Sta. Margarita Kebangsaan dan menjadi Sekolah Menengah Bebas Kebangsaan dengan nama Sekolah Menengah Napuro Kebangsaan, dan memperuntukkan dana"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["administrative","education"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 10222","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"2012-10-18","completenessNote":"全文，共 5 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra2012/ra_10222_2012.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H8675-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"Separation and Conversion into a National High School. – The Sta. Margarita National High School – Napuro Annex in Barangay Napuro, Municipality of Sta. Margarita, Province of Samar is hereby separated from the Sta. Margarita National High School and converted into an independent national high school to be known as Napuro National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8675-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Transfer of Assets and Liabilities. – All personnel, assets, liabilities and records of the Sta. Margarita National High School – Napuro Annex are hereby transferred to and absorbed by the Napuro National High School."}},{"id":"PH-H8675-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Appropriations. – The Secretary of Education shall immediately include in the Department’s program the operationalization of the Napuro National High School, the initial funding of which shall be charged against the current year’s appropriations of the Sta. Margarita National High School – Napuro Annex. Thereafter, the amount necessary for the continued operation of the school shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8675-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Implementation. – The Secretary of Education shall issue such rules and regulations as may be necessary to carry out the purpose of this Act."}},{"id":"PH-H8675-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"Effectivity. – This Act shall take effect fifteen (15) days after its publication in the Official Gazette."}}],"pack":"ph-p123","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act Separating the Sta. Margarita National High School - Napuro Annex in Barangay Napuro, Municipality of Sta. Margarita, Province of Samar From the Sta. Margarita National High School, Converting It Into An Independent National High School to Be Known as Napuro National High School and Appropriating Funds Therefor","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
